OL,3,GNEWSARight time to move on, says
OL,4,Aoutgoing party leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe departing leader of Mebyon Kernow
OL,7,Fhas said it is the "right time" for a
OL,8,Fchange in leadership.
OL,10,FDick Cole, who is understood to be the
OL,11,Flongest-serving leader of a political
OL,12,Fparty in the UK, will stand down after
OL,13,F29 years in the role.
OL,15,FHe is set to be replaced by Michael
OL,16,FBunney at the party's national
OL,17,Fconference in Truro, Cornwall, on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
