OL,3,GNEWSARight time to move on, says
OL,4,Aoutgoing party leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FCole, who joined the party aged 21 in
OL,7,F1988 and has been involved in its
OL,8,Fleadership for much of his life, said
OL,9,Fthe move was "a positive thing and good
OL,10,Ffor the party".
